A turn of the wheel, traced (Kosmos testing.md 18.855). With 0038's trace
on, the web process notes when a wheel event reaches its main thread,
against the time the UI process turned it; the port's
KosmosFrameTimes.cpp times the display that answers it from there and
says a `webkit: wheels` line. Nothing here changes what is done with the
event.

